   "what_this_does_not_imply_user": "This counts the loops of s* only, and it does NOT imply that nearly every pair certifies because most of s*'s loops are untouched (a wrong gloss, corrected by the authors on 2026-10-13 before preregistration). The certificate credits every competitor structure -w_L for each touched loop IT contains, up to about 19 kcal/mol at the Andronescu radius, so a pair is uncertain as soon as some structure lacking it, within that allowance of the MFE, forms a touched loop. That depends on the competitors' loops, not on s*'s. The expectation PRED carries is written from the TR0 pilot's measured label fractions instead."
